    pr_ref:  # 0386
    description: "cfg_nodes/rust.yaml, typescript.yaml and java.yaml do not declare\natomic_statement, so CfgBuilder recurses past their statement nodes down to\nleaf tokens and their def/use extractors are never called with a statement\nnode. Measured on one fixture: python 2 DDG edges, rust/typescript/go/java 0.\ngo.yaml was fixed in the Go PR; these three remain.\n\nRust and TypeScript additionally have no LanguageDdgSpec registered, so even\nwith the mapping fixed nothing would invoke them. Both halves belong here.\n\nREMEDY IS A GATE, NOT A SWEEP: for every language with a registered def/use\nextractor, assert (a) its mapping declares atomic_statement and (b) a fixture\nyields at least one DDG edge. That closes this for every future language at\nonce. ADR-0017 section 1d already documents atomic_statement as load-bearing\nand even predicts this failure -- the invariant was declared and unenforced."  # 0386
    fields: {}  # 0386
